{"post_id": "18125128579782046", "posted_at": "2026-09-08T12:25:58.889602", "text_file": "outputs/account3_parenting/20260908_122546.txt", "commented": false, "raw_result": {"post": {"recycling": {"enabled": false, "gapFreq": "month", "recycleCount": 0, "contentVariations": [], "contentVariationIndex": 0}, "_id": "6a9ffecd0311b2d6b5c6c2f1", "userId": "6a843db67c8c976bfff300ea", "title": "", "content": "習い事の話題は直近で使用済みなので、今回は**「園の役員決め」**の切り口で作成します。\n\n役員決めのくじ引き、今年もやってきました。\n「小さい子がいるから」「仕事が忙しいから」と次々に免除申請が出て、結局いつも同じ顔ぶれが残る感じ…😅\n\nみんな事情があるのはわかるんです。\nでも毎年やってる側からすると、「また私たちか」ってモヤモヤが積み重なっていくんですよね。\n💭\n\n「やってる人がやりたいんでしょ」って思われてたら、それはそれでちょっと悲しい。\n😮‍💨\n\n役員経験ある方、どうやって気持ちの折り合いつけましたか…？", "mediaItems": [], "platforms": [{"platform": "threads", "accountId": {"_id": "6a843e5477555aae01456e57", "profileId": "6a843dc47c8c976bfff30285", "platform": "threads", "displayName": "iikotobiyori", "isActive": true, "profilePicture": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/468314590_8453537411410202_5430368323558972174_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s206x206_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=30ff31&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy41NjUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=X_opOv0FLzcQ7kNvwEUqXa5&_nc_oc=AdrGd6mlmFyK4HsDbTfraNB3NmD4SQo5VWZqGdwmKhZiHhFV7fcbyNFtgHd1n96iTHQ&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=AP4hL3IEAAAA&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKNDtscxajvDcLcFcNmtswLR-UhwjEfegtuWE4EVywVVYbIGdZbV6RDwdEuetJK3N3LsCWx9ME8tA&oh=00_AQJjbs0-AQl9B4pGLl0WHsdgKa1wCvfQtseqRq64nAtykw&oe=6AA56938", "username": "iikotobiyori"}, "profileId": "6a843dc47c8c976bfff30285", "customMedia": [], "scheduledFor": "2026-09-08T12:25:49.022Z", "status": "published", "publishAttempts": 0, "contentHash": "6a645ebba227852b9f85ce4c6d458b0e", "_id": "6a9ffecd0311b2d6b5c6c2f2", "platformPostId": "18125128579782046", "platformPostUrl": "https://www.threads.com/@iikotobiyori/post/DdBrqDYF7pT", "publishedAt": "2026-09-08T12:25:58.558Z"}], "scheduledFor": "2026-09-08T12:25:49.022Z", "timezone": "UTC", "status": "published", "tags": [], "hashtags": [], "mentions": [], "visibility": "public", "crosspostingEnabled": true, "metadata": {"usageCounted": true}, "publishAttempts": 0, "createdAt": "2026-09-08T12:25:49.177Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-08T12:25:58.682Z", "__v": 0, "publishingClaimedAt": "2026-09-08T12:25:49.247Z"}, "message": "Post published successfully"}}
{"post_id": "17973328044068940", "posted_at": "2026-09-08T16:56:39.699116", "text_file": "outputs/account3_parenting/20260908_165624.txt", "commented": false, "raw_result": {"post": {"recycling": {"enabled": false, "gapFreq": "month", "recycleCount": 0, "contentVariations": [], "contentVariationIndex": 0}, "_id": "6aa03e3c89ef9ec62a705dd4", "userId": "6a843db67c8c976bfff300ea", "title": "", "content": "時短なのに「また早退？」って空気になるの、なんか違くないですか😮‍💨\n仕事の量が減るわけじゃないのに、時間で評価されてる感じがして。\n\n子供の発熱で早退するたびに、席に戻れないくらい罪悪感を感じるのしんどい。\n「うちは正社員で頑張ってるから」ってなんとなく言われた気がして、勝手に比べてしまう自分もいるんですが😭\n\n時短って、育児と仕事どちらも中途半端にしてる証拠、なのかな…って落ち込む夜もあって。\nでも精一杯やってるつもりではいるんです🥺\n\n時短で働いてるみなさん、職場での立ち位置ってどうやってキープしてますか？\nうまくやれてる方法があれば聞いてみたい💭", "mediaItems": [], "platforms": [{"platform": "threads", "accountId": {"_id": "6a843e5477555aae01456e57", "profileId": "6a843dc47c8c976bfff30285", "platform": "threads", "displayName": "iikotobiyori", "isActive": true, "profilePicture": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/468314590_8453537411410202_5430368323558972174_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s206x206_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=30ff31&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy41NjUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=X_opOv0FLzcQ7kNvwEUqXa5&_nc_oc=AdrGd6mlmFyK4HsDbTfraNB3NmD4SQo5VWZqGdwmKhZiHhFV7fcbyNFtgHd1n96iTHQ&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=AP4hL3IEAAAA&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKNDtscxajvDcLcFcNmtswLR-UhwjEfegtuWE4EVywVVYbIGdZbV6RDwdEuetJK3N3LsCWx9ME8tA&oh=00_AQJjbs0-AQl9B4pGLl0WHsdgKa1wCvfQtseqRq64nAtykw&oe=6AA56938", "username": "iikotobiyori"}, "profileId": "6a843dc47c8c976bfff30285", "customMedia": [], "scheduledFor": "2026-09-08T16:56:28.229Z", "status": "published", "publishAttempts": 0, "contentHash": "a78f8683342eac4812eb38a00c2497a4", "_id": "6aa03e3c89ef9ec62a705dd5", "platformPostId": "17973328044068940", "platformPostUrl": "https://www.threads.com/@iikotobiyori/post/DdCKod-kRj6", "publishedAt": "2026-09-08T16:56:39.343Z"}], "scheduledFor": "2026-09-08T16:56:28.229Z", "timezone": "UTC", "status":